{"4765740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Macht: Cosmic Engine", "steam_appid": 4765740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Road Map</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/8c1073079eedc0658af066fcef8e4083.avif?t=1787831133\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras_big/8c1073079eedc0658af066fcef8e4083.avif?t=1787831133 width=1560 height=1022 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/44c1b743d09529c71c948e0bd4795c5c.avif?t=1787831133\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras_big/44c1b743d09529c71c948e0bd4795c5c.webp?t=1787831133 width=1560 height=459 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule the Universe. Direct Civilizations. Simulate Reality.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Macht is not a generic space game; it is a <strong>100% Real-Physics-Based Macro Simulator and Grand Strategy</strong> masterpiece, built upon a custom  Cosmic Engine by Kestro Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You exist as an absolute <strong>Watcher,</strong> manipulating macro systems, balancing or disrupting star systems, and shaping the core lifecycles of evolving civilizations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/93e0b8d5764de0273e316d1bdee590a5.poster.avif?t=1787831133\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/93e0b8d5764de0273e316d1bdee590a5.webm?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/93e0b8d5764de0273e316d1bdee590a5.mp4?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Macro Astrophysics Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Macht simulates core macroeconomic and astrophysical rules—from gravitational forces to planetary orbits—using real-time physics subsystems. Alter planetary mass and manipulate gravitational fields to reshape entire systems. Your macro interventions are instantly simulated within the fabric of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/a96b30e3ecaeca7dc12e7f93c383d210.poster.avif?t=1787831133\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/a96b30e3ecaeca7dc12e7f93c383d210.webm?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/a96b30e3ecaeca7dc12e7f93c383d210.mp4?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watcher Directives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no linear story. Use the Watcher Directives panel to manipulate the fate of solar systems and societies at a macro level. Direct populations with your choices; lead them into systemic conflicts, societal collapses, or golden eras. Every directive shifts the sociological balance of the cosmos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/d5fa669a9ba046f2c9990441342d5e97.poster.avif?t=1787831133\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/d5fa669a9ba046f2c9990441342d5e97.webm?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/d5fa669a9ba046f2c9990441342d5e97.mp4?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Population and Lifecycles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulate the cosmic expansion of fundamental lifecycles, macro population movements, and the technological evolution of civilizations. Each civilization is a living multi-agent system driven by its own survival strategies and sociological frameworks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/bca191577fdedee6dd0e11a6235d1292.poster.avif?t=1787831133\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/bca191577fdedee6dd0e11a6235d1292.webm?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/bca191577fdedee6dd0e11a6235d1292.mp4?t=1787831133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISION: ABSOLUTE CONTROL AND STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond good and evil, Macht focuses entirely on the absolute execution of strength and will. In this universe, there is no predetermined moral compass; there are only your macro decisions and their subsequent physical or sociological consequences. You are the architect of this cosmic laboratory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765740/extras/b3f1df59dfae3a22793519b607324099.poster.avif?t=1787831133\" width=616 height=346 